    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have combined four mini-free games that our circle has produced and released in the past that can be played in 3 to 5 minutes into one &quot;Mini Game Collection.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content of each game is almost the same as the free game version, but in this mini-game collection, you can see the ``nipples'' that have been stubbornly hidden until now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, once you clear each game, you will be able to see bonus images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The menu screen and all games can be operated using the &quot;keyboard&quot; or &quot;gamepad&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can display the pause screen by pressing the Esc key, option button, or start button during game play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAs mentioned above, the games you can play in this collection are originally &quot;free games&quot;. Please note that you can always play for free if you don't need to see nipples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb&quot;Devil Tank&quot; is a game played on a vertical screen. Please note that the screen size will change during play.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have combined four mini-free games that our circle has produced and released in the past that can be played in 3 to 5 minutes into one &quot;Mini Game Collection.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content of each game is almost the same as the free game version, but in this mini-game collection, you can see the ``nipples'' that have been stubbornly hidden until now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, once you clear each game, you will be able to see bonus images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The menu screen and all games can be operated using the &quot;keyboard&quot; or &quot;gamepad&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can display the pause screen by pressing the Esc key, option button, or start button during game play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAs mentioned above, the games you can play in this collection are originally &quot;free games&quot;. Please note that you can always play for free if you don't need to see nipples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb&quot;Devil Tank&quot; is a game played on a vertical screen. Please note that the screen size will change during play.</p>",
